title: RF Vision
message: >-
  If you use RF Vision in your research, please cite this repository.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/NihaalGharat/RF_Vision
abstract: >-
  Privacy-preserving Wi-Fi Channel State Information (CSI) research
  platform for RF sensing, signal processing, localization, explainable
  AI, and interactive RF visualization. All processing is local.
